{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is the story of this game? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a rumor that there is a monster called Goat Stand. At first, people thought it was just a Goat that could stand and walk on two feet, not much different from other goats, until people kept disappearing because of it...... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> What is the gameplay of this game? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a first person horror game that combines elements of horror and comedy. In the game, you need to gather clues and find a way to lift the curse and safely escape from Goat Stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes chase battles and various puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains some hidden exploration elements, some of which can affect the ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> How many endings are there in this game? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains 3 endings, which are triggered by meeting certain conditions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The screenshot of the game is as follows\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/\u7f8a001.jpg?t=1745597565\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/\u7f8a003.jpg?t=1745597565\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/\u7f8a004.jpg?t=1745597565\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684410/extras/\u7f8a008.png?t=1745597565\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h